      "id": "claim_62d03cbcfbef4e7e97c319e8eab2fb3b",
      "statement": "The supervised ControlNet stage ships `PairedFidelitySpec` (ADR-0037) registered only in `manifold-train-controlnet` (`spine.registry.register(\"paired_fidelity\", PairedFidelitySpec)`); it is observe-only — logs `val/psnr` / `val/ssim` while the checkpoint monitor stays `val/x0_mae`. Extending the same monitor to the ControlNet-GRPO policy path is a deliberate ADR-0037 follow-up and is not yet implemented; until then, the GRPO shell's blanket `TrainingSpine.forbidden_callbacks={\"fid\": ...}` (ADR-0032) also excludes the `paired_fidelity` callback.",
      "evidence": [
