      "id": "claim_12aafbba59f74ff7bb603c1fe23e69ed",
      "statement": "The shipped eval surface is a single console entry `manifold-eval` plus the library-only `manifold.eval` barrel. `manifold-eval` (registered in `pyproject.toml` as `manifold-eval = \"manifold.eval.cli:main\"`) infers JiT vs. ControlNet from the before artifact's `model_index.json` (`pipeline_class`, ADR-0034 artifact-inference convention); `ComparisonPageBuilder` is library-only by design, not a console command.",
