    {
      "id": "claim_ae678f6d73f94c0dacd1b69e6811dc68",
      "statement": "Repo layout puts the offline before/after eval driver under `src/manifold/eval/` (`cli.py`, `before_after.py`, `comparison_page.py`, `slice_grid.py`) and the paired-fidelity metric + supervised-stage in-training callback under `src/manifold/metrics/{paired,paired_callback}.py`. ADR-0037 is the latest accepted ADR; the supervised paired-fidelity monitor ships in the current tree while the ControlNet-GRPO extension is a deliberate follow-up.",
